1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:04,260
No doctor on board. Only Eva: Super Intelligence, on your wrist.

2
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:05,625
— I feel alone.

3
00:00:05,575 --> 00:00:07,263
[Eva] I'm here. Let's call home.

4
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:11,370
Solar storm. Eighteen minutes.

5
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:12,860
Eva shows the way. Go.

6
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,200
Then Ana's heart stops.

7
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:16,780
The nearest passenger runs.

8
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:18,630
The station lights the defibrillator.

9
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:20,450
Eva paces every push.

10
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:21,550
[AED] Shock advised.

11
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:26,810
Eva guides, the AED decides, and Ana breathes.

12
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:29,760
Eva. Nobody is alone in space.

